m\">\n          <span class=\"mark\">&#9770;</span>\n          <span>Third week promises to surpass great record of first two weeks.</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"mark\">&#9770;</span>\n          <span>Canada leads with largest and most important order to date for G.-B. Co., beating our three chief competitors.</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <span class=\"mark\">&#9770;</span>\n          <span>Enthusiastic G.-B. Salesmen tell of their triumphs.</span>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-ornament\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ornament-bar\"></div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
